Data sources
------------
SEC EDGAR (https://www.sec.gov/edgar)
  Public domain. XBRL company facts, submissions and Form 13F data sets.
  Accessed with a descriptive User-Agent and within SEC fair-access limits.

CNINFO / SSE / SZSE announcements
  Public company disclosures. Stored as evidence with source links; not
  redistributed as a licensed dataset.

HKEXnews / HKEX DION (https://www.hkexnews.hk)
  Public announcements and substantial-shareholder notices. Accessed politely
  with rate limits; evidence and links are stored, not bulk redistributed.

Eastmoney F10 (https://emweb.eastmoney.com)
  Proprietary data, used for local research and enrichment with attribution.
  Raw data is not redistributed in bulk.

Google News RSS
  Headlines and links only; article content remains on the original site.

GLEIF (https://www.gleif.org)
  LEI and parent-relationship data, licensed under CC0.

Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org)
  Entity identifiers, licensed under CC0.

Wikipedia
  Index constituent cross-checks, licensed under CC BY-SA; attribution is kept
  in the relevant documentation.

Index constituent snapshots
  NASDAQ-100, Hang Seng Index, ChiNext 50, CSI A500 and S&P 500 snapshots are
  kept for internal research/demo with attribution. They are not licensed
  market-data feeds and must not be redistributed in bulk.

